      "text": "Sukhi suji aur maida mix mein dahi aur thoda paani daal kar tight (thoda kaccha) dough banayein; 7 minute tak maarke (knead) masaj karein phir 1 tbsp oil milayein aur 3-4 minute aur masaj karein.",
